      "cooked": "<p>Found one burried in my harddrive, there's a lot of lore in here that we didn't know at the time, some of which the Letters Page has subsequently revealed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We got our first confimation that Proletariet's powers came from an Oblivion Shard, that the Scholar's stone was not created with one.</p><p>Iron Legacy fell through time when he was defeated by the \"core timeline\" heroes.</p><p>Absolute Zero produces \"Kidney Stones\" of waste, it is not pleasant.</p><p>Citizen Truth may be more important than we realised.</p><p>Christopher mentiosn in passing a Sentinels Copmuter game he would like (relevent right now!).</p><p>OblivAeon is not part of a race.</p><p>Some tidbits about \"The Wager\".</p><p>CON is a She.</p><p>Anubis (tactics) is not Anubis, just some person in a costume.</p><p>And lots more!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Read it all in the attached file, or&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/gw7fo399kbaelbx/Livestream%2016-03-09.txt?dl=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Link</a><span>, for peoples who prefer an online version.</span></p>",
