      "raw": "<p>Found one burried in my harddrive, there&#39;s a lot of lore in here that we didn&#39;t know at the time, some of which the Letters Page has subsequently revealed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We got our first confimation that Proletariet&#39;s powers came from an Oblivion Shard, that the Scholar&#39;s stone was not created with one.</p><p>Iron Legacy fell through time when he was defeated by the &quot;core timeline&quot; heroes.</p><p>Absolute Zero produces &quot;Kidney Stones&quot; of waste, it is not pleasant.</p><p>Citizen Truth may be more important than we realised.</p><p>Christopher mentiosn in passing a Sentinels Copmuter game he would like (relevent right now!).</p><p>OblivAeon is not part of a race.</p><p>Some tidbits about &quot;The Wager&quot;.</p><p>CON is a She.</p><p>Anubis (tactics) is not Anubis, just some person in a costume.</p><p>And lots more!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Read it all in the attached file, or&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/gw7fo399kbaelbx/Livestream%2016-03-09.txt?dl=0\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Link</a><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">, for peoples who prefer an online version.</span></p>",
